course: dictionary
lesson: 6226
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. You can tell which meaning the author wants by reading the context: the words and sentences around it. «A cement mixer lorry keeps its drum turning so the concrete does not set.» Here the clues are cement, concrete and drum, so mixer means a machine.
explain: Try your meaning in the sentence to check it. Does «a machine for mixing concrete» fit? Yes, it does. Now try a different meaning in the same sentence and see if it still makes sense.
explain: Phrases can help too. A «good mixer» is not a machine at all. It is a person who makes friends easily. The two words next to mixer, good and mixer, tell you that the meaning is about people.
fact: Context means the words and sentences around a word.
fact: «Mixer» can mean a machine or tool for mixing things, such as a food mixer or a cement mixer.
fact: «Mixer» can also mean a drink, such as lemonade or tonic, mixed with another drink.
fact: A «good mixer» is a person who makes friends easily.
fact: In music or on TV, a sound mixer is a machine for mixing sounds, or the person who does it.
exercise: «A cement mixer lorry keeps its drum turning so the concrete does not set.» What is a cement mixer? | A kind of crane | *A machine for mixing concrete | A drink made with lemonade | A person who makes friends easily
exercise: In music, what does a sound mixer do? | Bakes bread in a warm cupboard | Lifts heavy loads with a crane | Pushes posts deep into the ground | *Balances voices and instruments
exercise: Maya is a good mixer. What does that mean? | She does not like parties | She is good at baking cakes | *She makes friends easily | She drives a cement mixer lorry
test: «Bread is flour, water, yeast and salt mixed in huge mixers.» In this sentence, mixers are | Friends | *Machines that mix ingredients | Drinks | Kinds of bread
test: Which of these is a mixer that is a drink? | *Tonic | Cement | Drum | Crane
exam: «A digger scoops, a crane lifts, a mixer lorry keeps concrete moving.» What does mixer mean in this sentence? | A drink such as juice | A party where people meet and get to know each other | *A machine for mixing things | A person who makes friends easily
